{"version": 2, "cells": [{"id": "5b7e0c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000201", "kind": "text", "input": [{"text": "Write a logline for a short film about a lighthouse keeper."}], "endpoint": "openrouter", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "output": [{"text": "A lonely lighthouse keeper on a storm-battered island hears a distress call from a ship that *should not exist*. As the signal grows clearer, he must decide whether to answer before the sea claims one more life."}], "state": "done", "versions": [{"id": "5b7e0c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000101", "input": [{"text": "Write a logline about a lighthouse keeper."}], "endpoint": "openrouter", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "output": [{"text": "A keeper keeps the light."}], "state": "done", "time": 1793146001}, {"id": "5b7e0c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000102", "input": [{"text": "Write a logline for a short film about a lighthouse keeper."}], "endpoint": "openrouter", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "output": [{"text": "A lonely lighthouse keeper on a storm-battered island hears a distress call from a ship that *should not exist*. As the signal grows clearer, he must decide whether to answer before the sea claims one more life."}], "state": "done", "time": 1793146002}, {"id": "5b7e0c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000103", "input": [{"text": "Write a darker logline."}], "endpoint": "openrouter", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "output": [{"text": "The keeper answers. **Nothing** answers back."}], "state": "done", "time": 1793146003}], "current": 1}, {"id": "5b7e0c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000202", "kind": "markdown", "input": [{"text": "## The Last Signal \u2728\n\nA short film in **three acts**, told from the keeper's side. See [the treatment](https://example.org/treatment).\n\n> **\u26a0\ufe0f Draft:** the ending is `TBD` \ud83e\uddea"}], "state": "done"}], "selected": "5b7e0c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000201"}